        "TileImage": "$($repository fc3dee19-c692-482d-90bc-b7900537927f).Image",
        "Description": "Silvio Caruso could grow to be the most gifted stem cell researcher in the world - and could be used for vast global benefit or harm.\r\rWhich, may hinge on his only remaining parent, Isabella, who after losing her husband and other sons, maintains a highly controlling relationship to keep Silvio dependent.\r\rRemoving the influence of Isabella and Dr. Richardson, a scout for Ether Corporation, might protect Silvio&apos;s future, thus allowing him to flourish and contribute to a better world of tomorrow.",
